&lt;p&gt;    `INTERPRETERS` is surprisingly an exclusion list @zjffdu &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/master/.travis.yml#L40&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/master/.travis.yml#L40&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16032815" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 1 Jun 2017 11:27:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user zjffdu commented on the issue:&lt;/p&gt;

