&lt;p&gt;    @andreaTP That&apos;s is intended. It would be converted to inclusive. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    ```&lt;br/&gt;
    MODULES=&quot;-pl $(echo .,zeppelin-interpreter,${INTERPRETERS} | sed &apos;s/!//g&apos;)&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
