&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2383&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2383&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Q: Does -Pr works at the latest spark distribution?&lt;br/&gt;
    A: Not sure. It works with 2.0.2. I haven&apos;t tried to compile it against 2.1.1. Any specific error you are getting?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16038378" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 6 Jun 2017 08:36:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user jongyoul commented on the issue:&lt;/p&gt;

